  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "The children open the green door and go into a garden. A golden bird sits on a branch. It does not sing. It only ticks like a clock: Tick-tock, tick-tock. A little stone is missing from its wing. “Tom, our radio in the room has a blue stone!” calls Maya. “Quick!”",
